              CPlay (beta)
        Fast Console Audio Player
      -----------------------------
      A lightning-fast, dependency-
      free audio player built for 
      IWBasic 2.5 and the BASS engine.
      
      Features:
     - MP3 & FLAC streaming support
     - Native ID3v1/v2 & Vorbis parser
     - 60-char text box for Comments 
        & Lyrics with UTF-8 / OEM fix
     - Dynamic retro color themes
     - Side-by-side folder cover art
      
